{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"publication\": {\n    \"ref\": \"PMID:31505548; DOI:10.1093/brain/awz141; PMCID:PMC6598629\",\n    \"title\": \"Freezing of gait in Parkinson’s disease reflects a sudden derangement of locomotor network dynamics\",\n    \"publication_status\": \"published\",\n    \"version_of_candidate\": null,\n    \"study_id_candidate\": \"study_candidate_PMID31505548\",\n    \"cohort_id_candidate\": \"cohort_candidate_Pozzi2019_PD_STNDBS_7\",\n    \"cohort_relation_basis\": \"原始研究，7名接受双侧STN-DBS的特发性帕金森病患者。5名FOG+（wue03、wue04、wue10、wue11、nwk01），2名FOG−（wue06、wue07）。6名患者使用Activa PC+S，1名使用AlphaDBS。患者在手术后约4年接受测试，nwk01为术后7年。Discussion明确指出，除nwk01外，所有患者的个体纹状体DAT结合数据此前已在Arnulfo et al. (2018)报告，提示可能与该研究存在患者或影像数据队列重叠；但不足以证明本研究的电生理数据已在此前发表。不同论文之间的队列重叠仍需通过患者特征、中心及招募记录进一步核查。\",\n    \"source_type\": \"primary\",\n    \"basis\": \"fulltext\",\n    \"fulltext_checked\": true\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"PMID31505548_E01\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性、受试者内事件相关电生理研究；同步双侧STN-LFP、64通道头皮EEG及下肢运动学记录；比较自然行走与实际FOG相关时间窗。\",\n      \"population\": \"7名双侧STN-DBS特发性帕金森病患者；5名FOG+、2名FOG−。14次实际FOG事件来自5名FOG+患者。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 7,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 5,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 7,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 14,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": \"14根双侧DBS导线，56个物理触点；每名患者双侧STN记录，共14个双极LFP记录通道。\",\n      \"missing_reason\": \"总试次数未报告，仅报告每人4–8次。n_enrolled=15根据Discussion中9名Activa PC+S患者及6名AlphaDBS招募患者计算；7人获得可用记录。5名FOG+患者产生14次实际冻结事件。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"unclear\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。作者没有将实际观察到的事件分类为akinetic、trembling-in-place或其他亚型。Discussion仅提到临床FOG可能存在trembling in place、shuffling forward等不同表现。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown。报告FOG+与FOG−分组，但没有明确患者属于OFF-FOG、ONOFF-FOG或ON-FOG。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off：测试前至少12小时未服用最后一次抗帕金森药物；测试在早晨进行。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"双侧STN-DBS长期治疗，测试前至少2个月刺激参数保持稳定；实验前暂停刺激2小时，测试时为Stim-Off。LFP采用围绕临床治疗触点的双极记录配置。未报告具体频率、幅度和脉宽数值。\",\n      \"task\": \"赤足、自然地面行走，15米自选速度路径，包含一个转向门和两个普通门。14次FOG全部发生于接近门口时；未发生于转弯或接近路径终点。比较有效行走、FPRE、FSTART、FSTOP及FPOST。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN背外侧区域LFP；同时记录64通道头皮EEG，包含SMA、M1、PC及颞叶控制区域。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN局部场电位功率谱密度（PSD），分别考察低频θ-α功率及β功率。PSD各频率点以4–80 Hz总功率归一化，不是未经归一化的绝对功率。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"θ-α频段4–13 Hz；β频段13–35 Hz。每个条件采用1.5秒时间窗，多锥窗谱估计，时间频率带宽1.5、两个Slepian tapers、频率分辨率1 Hz。每名患者根据行走期间平均PSD识别频段峰值，并使用FWHM确定个体化分析频带。归一化基准为4–80 Hz总功率。\",\n      \"finding\": \"作者报告FOG相关时间窗与有效行走相比，双侧STN低频θ-α功率没有显著差异。结果没有提供FPRE、FSTART、FSTOP、FPOST各阶段独立的定量效应值，因此不能据此断言每个阶段分别存在相同的零效应。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"方向：未检测到显著功率差异。没有报告具体效应量、置信区间或精确P值。Fig.3A显示相对功率变化无显著差异。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"PSD按1.5秒epoch计算。研究总体统计方法为Wilcoxon rank-sum test，并采用Bonferroni多重比较校正。该项比较具体的患者级与epoch级统计聚合方式未充分说明。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究领域级偏倚风险清单，非经验证量表。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"仅7/15名候选患者获得可用记录；作者指出设备类型、晚期疾病及严重OFF状态限制了记录获取。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用IMU冻结指数并由两名独立评审者通过同步视频临床确认；未报告评审者间一致性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"报告滤波、ICA、Laplacian及运动伪迹检查，但作者承认EEG电极未与个体MRI共注册。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis; Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"统一Med-Off/Stim-Off条件，但疾病严重程度、步速和门口环境挑战等因素未充分建模。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"部分分析将所有患者的epoch归一化后合并比较，未报告患者或事件层级聚类校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用Bonferroni校正，但涉及多个频段、ROI、时间阶段及对照条件，完整校正家族未详细说明。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有建立预测模型，此域不适用。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods and Results\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告预注册或预先指定的统计分析计划，无法核查选择性报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"全文未报告预注册或分析计划\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"FOG事件仅14次，来自5名患者；统计功效有限。局部STN功率的阴性结果不能证明STN完全不参与FOG。该指标是归一化相对功率，不能与绝对功率直接等同。\",\n      \"quote\": \"did not find any differences during gait freezing in comparison to (effective) walking\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Subthalamic oscillatory activity and connectivity during gait freezing\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 3A\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"PMID31505548_E02\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性、受试者内事件相关电生理研究；双侧STN-LFP功率比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"7名双侧STN-DBS患者，5名FOG+、2名FOG−；实际FOG事件来自5名FOG+患者。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 7,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 5,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 7,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 14,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": \"14根DBS导线，56个物理触点；14个双极STN-LFP记录通道。\",\n      \"missing_reason\": \"总试次数未报告，仅报告每人4–8次。事件条件由5名FOG+患者的14次冻结事件提供。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"unclear\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off，末次抗帕金森药物至少12小时前；测试时Stim-Off，刺激暂停2小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"双侧STN-DBS长期治疗，参数稳定至少2个月；测试前停刺激2小时。记录使用临床刺激触点周围的双极配置。具体刺激频率、幅度、脉宽未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"自然地面行走，赤足、自选速度，15米路径及门口通行；比较有效行走和FOG相关时间窗。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN背外侧区域LFP。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN局部β频段PSD相对功率；与θ-α功率分开提取。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"β频段13–35 Hz；个体化峰值频带采用FWHM确定。1.5秒epoch，多锥窗谱估计，频率分辨率1 Hz；PSD以4–80 Hz总功率归一化。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FOG期间STN β功率相对于有效行走没有显著差异；作者也未发现STN+与STN−之间存在显著的相应差异。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"未发现显著变化；没有报告具体百分比效应量、置信区间或精确P值。Fig.3B显示相对β功率差异不显著。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"按1.5秒epoch计算PSD；总体采用Wilcoxon rank-sum test和Bonferroni校正。该比较的独立统计单位及患者内聚类处理未充分说明。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究领域级偏倚风险清单，非经验证量表。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"仅7/15名候选患者获得可用记录，且患者处于疾病较晚期。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用IMU和两名独立视频评审者确认实际FOG，但未报告评审一致性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"有滤波和伪迹处理流程，但无法完全排除残余运动伪迹。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"测试状态标准化，但门口任务难度及疾病严重程度仍可能影响结果。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"多epoch重复测量，未明确报告患者层级聚类校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"报告Bonferroni校正，但完整比较家族未详细说明。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods and Results\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告预注册或预先分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"全文未报告预注册或分析计划\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"本研究局部STN β功率阴性结果与皮层-STN耦合结果不同，不能将局部振荡功率和跨区域同步视为同一指标。作者在Discussion中指出，即使没有检测到事件相关STN活动变化，持续存在的过度β同步仍可能影响FOG的发展。\",\n      \"quote\": \"The relative change of STN β-power during gait freezing did not differ with respect to (effective) walking.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Subthalamic oscillatory activity and connectivity during gait freezing\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 3B\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"PMID31505548_E03\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性、受试者内事件相关电生理研究；STN β-burst时间特征分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"7名双侧STN-DBS患者，5名FOG+、2名FOG−；14次FOG事件来自5名FOG+患者。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 7,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 5,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 7,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 14,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": \"14根DBS导线，56个物理触点；14个双极STN-LFP记录通道。\",\n      \"missing_reason\": \"总试次数未报告，每人4–8次。β-burst持续时间分析将FSTART和FSTOP合并；没有单独报告每个事件阶段的burst数量。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"during_FOG\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off至少12小时；Stim-Off至少2小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"长期双侧STN-DBS，参数稳定至少2个月；实验前暂停刺激2小时。使用临床刺激触点周围的双极LFP配置；数值刺激参数未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"自然向前行走时实际发生的FOG；将每次冻结事件的FSTART和FSTOP两个1.5秒窗口合并，与等时长随机选取的有效行走窗口比较。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN背外侧区域LFP。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN β-burst持续时间。注意本研究此处测量的是burst duration，不是平均β功率、burst占据率或burst发生率。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"使用每名患者行走条件下的β峰值频率（1 Hz频率bin）；Morlet wavelet，FWHM=4；波幅相对于行走波幅包络进行z-score标准化。STN+与STN−的幅度阈值分别为1.35和1.45。burst持续时间采用FWHM方法确定；FSTART与FSTOP合并分析。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FOG期间STN β-burst持续时间与有效行走相比没有显著差异。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"无显著差异；未报告具体持续时间均值、中位数、效应量、置信区间或精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"以检测到的β-burst持续时间分布为分析对象；Wilcoxon rank-sum test，Bonferroni校正。是否按患者或事件聚类处理未报告。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究领域级偏倚风险清单，非经验证量表。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"只有5名FOG患者提供冻结事件；整个有效电生理样本为7/15。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"IMU检测并由两名独立评审者视频确认，但未报告评审一致性和FOG亚型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用小波变换和标准化处理，但未报告所有事件的信噪比及逐事件伪迹排除率。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"测试条件一致，但冻结诱发环境及步态严重程度可能影响burst持续时间。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"burst嵌套于epoch、事件及患者，未报告多层级聚类模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用Bonferroni校正，但分析包含多个频段和条件。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods and Results\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预注册信息，无法核对预设burst结局。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"全文未报告预注册或分析计划\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是与Anidi et al. (2018)报告的FOG期间STN β-burst持续时间增加存在直接结果冲突的指标。本文Discussion提出可能来源包括任务差异：本研究为自然向前行走，Anidi et al.研究采用坐位重复踏步；其他研究还使用转弯诱发FOG。作者同时指出不同临床FOG表现可能具有不同电生理底物。上述解释属于作者提出的可能原因，并未在本研究中通过实验直接验证。当前样本仅5名FOG患者、14次事件。\",\n      \"quote\": \"No difference was found in the distribution of the β-burst duration during gait freezing with respect to (effective) walking.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Subthalamic oscillatory activity and connectivity during gait freezing; Discussion\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 3C\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"PMID31505548_E04\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性事件相关电生理研究；双侧STN间β频段跨半球耦合分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"7名双侧STN-DBS患者，5名FOG+、2名FOG−；实际冻结事件来自5名FOG+患者。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 7,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 5,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 7,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 14,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": \"14根DBS导线，56个物理触点；14个双极STN-LFP记录通道。\",\n      \"missing_reason\": \"总试次数未报告；每人4–8次。具体FSTART阶段贡献的有效epoch数量未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"during_FOG\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off至少12小时；Stim-Off至少2小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"长期双侧STN-DBS，参数稳定至少2个月；测试时刺激暂停2小时。临床刺激触点周围双极记录；具体刺激参数未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"自然地面行走时实际FOG的开始阶段，即FSTART：冻结事件最初1.5秒。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN-LFP，分别记录STN+与STN−。\",\n      \"measure\": \"双侧STN之间的β频段跨半球耦合，采用cross-power spectral density（CPSD）积分指标；不是单侧STN β功率。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"β频段13–35 Hz，使用个体化峰值频带；1.5秒epoch；耦合指标相对于每名患者有效行走期间的平均值计算百分比相对变化。另报告β频段500 ms窗口敏感性分析。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FSTART时双侧STN之间的β耦合呈增加方向，但作者明确指出相关变化没有达到统计学显著性。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"方向：增加；未达到统计学显著性。没有报告具体效应量、置信区间或精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"CPSD积分后以患者行走均值归一化；连接分析将所有患者的epoch归一化值合并，采用Wilcoxon rank-sum test及Bonferroni校正。未报告患者层级聚类处理。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究领域级偏倚风险清单，非经验证量表。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"仅7/15名候选患者获得可用记录，FOG事件来自5人。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"冻结事件经过IMU识别和视频临床确认，但未报告评审一致性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用同步和伪迹处理，但无法完全排除残余运动伪迹。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"标准化测试状态，但未充分控制步态严重程度和环境因素。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"多epoch归一化后合并，未报告患者内重复测量聚类校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用Bonferroni校正，但涉及多个时间窗及频段。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods and Results\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告预注册。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"全文未报告预注册或分析计划\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"变化未达到统计学显著性，不能据此认定存在稳定的跨半球β耦合变化。患者数和冻结事件数较少，且跨epoch统计可能低估重复测量的不确定性。\",\n      \"quote\": \"an increase of β-coupling (FSTART)\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Subthalamic oscillatory activity and connectivity during gait freezing\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 3D\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"PMID31505548_E05\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性事件相关电生理研究；双侧STN间β频段跨半球耦合分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"7名双侧STN-DBS患者，5名FOG+、2名FOG−；实际冻结事件来自5名FOG+患者。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 7,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 5,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 7,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 14,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": \"14根DBS导线，56个物理触点；14个双极STN-LFP记录通道。\",\n      \"missing_reason\": \"总试次数未报告；每人4–8次。具体FSTOP阶段贡献的有效epoch数量未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"during_FOG\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off至少12小时；Stim-Off至少2小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"长期双侧STN-DBS，参数稳定至少2个月；测试时刺激暂停2小时。临床刺激触点周围双极记录；具体刺激参数未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"自然地面行走时实际FOG的结束阶段，即FSTOP：冻结事件最后1.5秒。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN-LFP，分别记录STN+与STN−。\",\n      \"measure\": \"双侧STN之间的β频段跨半球CPSD耦合。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"β频段13–35 Hz，个体化峰值频带；1.5秒epoch；以患者自身行走期间平均耦合值归一化。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FSTOP时双侧STN之间的β耦合呈下降方向，与FSTART时观察到的增加方向相反；但整体变化未达到统计学显著性。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"方向：下降；未达到统计学显著性。未报告精确P值、效应量或置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"CPSD积分及患者内行走基线归一化；所有患者epoch归一化值合并，Wilcoxon rank-sum test及Bonferroni校正；未报告聚类模型。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究领域级偏倚风险清单，非经验证量表。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"仅7/15名候选患者获得可用记录，FOG事件来自5人。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"IMU与两名独立视频评审者确认冻结，但未报告一致性指标。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"进行了信号同步和伪迹处理，但残余运动伪迹仍可能存在。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"门口环境及疾病严重程度可能影响跨半球耦合。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"epoch级数据池化，未明确报告患者层级聚类校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"报告Bonferroni校正，但完整比较家族未说明。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods and Results\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告预注册。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"全文未报告预注册或分析计划\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"FSTOP阶段的下降方向与FSTART阶段的增加方向构成时间上的变化趋势，但统计学不显著，不能据此建立稳定的双侧STN同步变化模型。\",\n      \"quote\": \"a reduction in the synchronization between the two STN (FSTOP)\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Subthalamic oscillatory activity and connectivity during gait freezing\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 3D\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"PMID31505548_E06\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性事件相关电生理研究；皮层—STN低频跨区域耦合分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"7名双侧STN-DBS患者；5名FOG+患者贡献实际冻结事件，2名FOG−患者贡献非事件步行参考数据。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 7,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 5,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 7,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 14,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": \"14根DBS导线，56个物理触点；14个双极STN-LFP记录通道。\",\n      \"missing_reason\": \"总试次数未报告，每人4–8次。FPRE是每次实际FOG发生前紧邻的1.5秒；具体有效FPRE epoch总数未单独报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"pre_FOG_event_associated\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off至少12小时；Stim-Off至少2小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"双侧STN-DBS长期稳定治疗至少2个月；实验时停刺激2小时。使用临床刺激触点周围双极记录配置；具体治疗参数未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"自然地面行走中实际FOG发生前紧邻的FPRE窗口，定义为FOG开始前1.5秒。每个FPRE均与随后实际发生的FOG事件对应，不是FOG+患者的一般行走试次。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN背外侧区域LFP；同步64通道EEG，分析同侧SMA、M1和PC区域。\",\n      \"measure\": \"皮层—同侧STN低频θ-α跨区域耦合，采用CPSD积分指标。主要结果发生于纹状体多巴胺能支配较少的半球H−。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"θ-α频段4–13 Hz，基于个体化峰值及FWHM确定频带；1.5秒epoch；CPSD积分后相对于每名患者有效行走期间的平均耦合值计算百分比相对变化。\",\n      \"finding\": \"皮层—STN低频解耦在实际冻结发生之前的FPRE窗口已经出现，定位于纹状体多巴胺能支配较少的H−半球。这是与随后实际FOG事件关联的前事件证据。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"方向：皮层—STN低频耦合下降。Fig.4A报告统计显著性标记（P<0.05）；正文未提供精确P值、具体百分比、置信区间或患者级效应量。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"每名患者以行走平均耦合值进行归一化；随后将各患者epoch级归一化值合并，采用Wilcoxon rank-sum test及Bonferroni校正。未报告患者内聚类或混合效应模型。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究领域级偏倚风险清单，非经验证量表。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"只有5名患者产生FOG事件；7/15名候选患者有可用神经记录。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"实际FOG由IMU和两名独立视频评审者确认，FPRE与随后真实事件时间对齐；未报告评审一致性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"报告EEG伪迹去除和同步处理，但EEG未与个体MRI共注册。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis; Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FPRE与实际事件关联，但门口接近过程中的任务难度、步速和其他行为变化仍可能影响耦合。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"epoch级观测跨患者池化，未报告按患者和事件聚类校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用Bonferroni校正，但多ROI和多时间阶段分析较多。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods and Results\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预注册信息。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"全文未报告预注册或分析计划\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"FPRE是事件前相关而非因果证据。作者报告该模式出现在所有患者及冻结事件中，但患者数仅5，统计分析存在epoch级池化问题。不能将FPRE解耦直接解释为导致FOG的必要或充分条件。\",\n      \"quote\": \"This desynchronization started at the transition from (effective) walking into gait freezing [i.e. pre-freezing (FPRE)].\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Cortical-subthalamic network during gait freezing\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 4A; Fig. 5\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"PMID31505548_E07\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性事件相关电生理研究；皮层—STN低频跨区域耦合分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"7名双侧STN-DBS患者，5名FOG+、2名FOG−；实际FOG事件来自5名FOG+患者。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 7,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 5,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 7,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 14,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": \"14根DBS导线，56个物理触点；14个双极STN-LFP记录通道。\",\n      \"missing_reason\": \"总试次数未报告，每人4–8次。FSTART为每次实际冻结事件开始后的第一个1.5秒窗口。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"during_FOG\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off至少12小时；Stim-Off至少2小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"双侧STN-DBS长期稳定治疗至少2个月；实验时暂停刺激2小时。使用临床刺激触点周围双极记录配置；数值参数未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"自然行走时实际FOG开始阶段，FSTART，即冻结事件最初1.5秒。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN-LFP及同步64通道EEG；皮层ROI包括SMA、M1、PC。\",\n      \"measure\": \"皮层—同侧STN低频θ-α耦合，使用CPSD积分。比较H−半球的皮层ROI与同侧STN。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"θ-α频段4–13 Hz；个体化峰值频带采用FWHM确定；1.5秒epoch；相对变化以每名患者行走平均耦合值归一化。\",\n      \"finding\": \"实际FOG开始时，H−半球皮层与STN之间出现低频解耦。作者报告该模式涉及SMA、M1和PC等运动相关皮层区域，而颞叶控制ROI未出现相应变化。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"方向：H−半球皮层—STN低频耦合下降。Fig.4A提供P<0.05显著性标记；未报告具体效应量、置信区间及精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"每名患者以有效行走平均值归一化，随后合并患者epoch进行Wilcoxon rank-sum test，并进行Bonferroni校正。未报告患者级聚类校正。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究领域级偏倚风险清单，非经验证量表。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG事件仅来自5名患者，整个可用样本为7/15。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"IMU及两名独立视频评审者确认实际冻结，但未报告一致性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采取滤波、ICA及同步处理，但EEG空间定位没有个体MRI共注册。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis; Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"运动相关ROI与颞叶控制ROI比较增强了特异性，但门口任务中的其他运动需求仍可能影响耦合。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—Cortical-subthalamic network during gait freezing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"患者epoch合并分析，未报告多层级统计模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"Bonferroni校正，但ROI、频段和时间条件较多。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods and Results\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预注册信息。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"全文未报告预注册或分析计划\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是皮层—STN网络耦合证据，不是STN局部β功率或STN单区域放电增加的证据。SMA、M1和PC的精确解剖定位受头皮EEG空间定位限制。患者数较少且epoch级池化可能夸大统计精度。\",\n      \"quote\": \"During gait freezing (FSTART–FSTOP), the cortex and the STN decoupled selectively in the hemisphere with less striatal dopamine.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Cortical-subthalamic network during gait freezing\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 4A; Fig. 5\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"PMID31505548_E08\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性事件相关电生理研究；皮层—STN低频跨区域耦合分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"7名双侧STN-DBS患者；5名FOG+患者贡献14次实际冻结事件，2名FOG−患者提供非事件步行数据。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 7,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 5,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 7,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 14,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": \"14根DBS导线，56个物理触点；14个双极STN-LFP记录通道。\",\n      \"missing_reason\": \"总试次数未报告，每人4–8次。FSTOP为实际FOG最后1.5秒，未单独报告该阶段epoch总数。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"during_FOG\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off至少12小时；Stim-Off至少2小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"长期双侧STN-DBS；参数稳定至少2个月；测试前停刺激2小时。具体刺激频率、幅度和脉宽未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"自然行走中实际FOG的最后阶段FSTOP，即冻结结束前最后1.5秒。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN-LFP及同步64通道EEG；皮层ROI包括SMA、M1、PC。\",\n      \"measure\": \"皮层—同侧STN低频θ-α耦合，CPSD积分指标。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"θ-α频段4–13 Hz；个体化峰值频带FWHM；1.5秒epoch；相对于患者自身行走平均耦合值计算百分比变化。\",\n      \"finding\": \"在FOG最后1.5秒，H−半球皮层—STN低频解耦仍然存在。作者将其描述为从冻结开始到冻结结束持续存在的网络变化。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"方向：持续下降。Fig.4A报告P<0.05显著性标记；没有报告精确效应量、置信区间或精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者内行走均值归一化后，合并各患者epoch进行Wilcoxon rank-sum test和Bonferroni校正；未报告患者层级聚类校正。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究领域级偏倚风险清单，非经验证量表。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"仅5名患者提供冻结事件，且7/15名候选患者有可用记录。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"实际冻结经过IMU和视频评审确认，但未报告评审者一致性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"进行了EEG及LFP信号处理，但EEG未与个体MRI共注册。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis; Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"门口环境和步态调整可能与FOG同时发生。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"epoch级池化，未报告患者层级聚类校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"报告Bonferroni校正，但涉及多个频段、ROI和时间条件。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods and Results\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预注册信息。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"全文未报告预注册或分析计划\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该结果提示低频耦合异常延续至冻结结束前，但无法证明解耦是维持FOG的必要机制。没有报告FSTOP阶段独立患者级效应量。\",\n      \"quote\": \"The decoupling was maintained during the freezing episode [from FSTART to FSTOP].\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Cortical-subthalamic network during gait freezing\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 4A; Fig. 5\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"PMID31505548_E09\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性事件相关电生理研究；皮层—STN低频跨区域耦合分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"7名双侧STN-DBS患者，5名FOG+患者贡献实际冻结事件。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 7,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 5,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 7,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 14,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": \"14根DBS导线，56个物理触点；14个双极STN-LFP记录通道。\",\n      \"missing_reason\": \"总试次数未报告，每人4–8次。FPOST为FOG解决后紧接的1.5秒窗口。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"offset_recovery\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off至少12小时；Stim-Off至少2小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"长期双侧STN-DBS；参数稳定至少2个月；实验前停刺激2小时。\",\n      \"task\": \"自然行走中FOG解除后的恢复阶段FPOST，即冻结解决后紧接的1.5秒。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN-LFP及同步64通道EEG；皮层ROI包括SMA、M1、PC。\",\n      \"measure\": \"皮层—同侧STN低频θ-α耦合，CPSD积分指标。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"θ-α频段4–13 Hz；个体化峰值频带FWHM；1.5秒epoch；相对于患者自身行走平均耦合值归一化。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FOG解除并恢复有效行走后，之前观察到的皮层—STN低频解耦消失，耦合恢复至正常行走模式。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"方向：耦合恢复；正文未提供恢复幅度、精确P值或置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者内行走均值归一化；epoch级数据合并，Wilcoxon rank-sum test及Bonferroni校正。未报告患者层级聚类处理。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究领域级偏倚风险清单，非经验证量表。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"只有5名FOG患者提供事件数据，整体有效样本为7/15。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"实际FOG由运动学与视频评审确认，但未报告评审一致性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"报告信号处理及伪迹控制，但EEG未与个体MRI共注册。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis; Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"恢复过程可能伴随步速、步态幅度及环境需求改变。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"epoch级数据池化，未报告患者层级聚类校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用Bonferroni校正，但涉及多ROI和多阶段。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods and Results\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告预注册。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"全文未报告预注册或分析计划\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"恢复期耦合变化属于时间相关观察，不能区分解耦消失是步态恢复的原因还是恢复后的伴随现象。\",\n      \"quote\": \"vanished with the recovery of a normal locomotor pattern (FPOST).\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Cortical-subthalamic network during gait freezing\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 4A; Fig. 5\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"PMID31505548_E10\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性事件相关电生理研究；FOG与成功通过门口的非冻结步态对照。\",\n      \"population\": \"7名双侧STN-DBS患者；5名FOG+患者提供FOG事件；研究报告32个成功通过门口的1.5秒epoch。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 7,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 5,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 7,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 14,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": \"14根DBS导线，56个物理触点；14个双极STN-LFP记录通道。\",\n      \"missing_reason\": \"总试次数未报告；成功通过门口的对照为32个1.5秒epoch，但具体贡献患者数未单独报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"during_FOG\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off至少12小时；Stim-Off至少2小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"长期双侧STN-DBS，参数稳定至少2个月；测试时暂停刺激2小时。\",\n      \"task\": \"比较自然行走中实际FOG阶段与成功通过门口的有效行走阶段；后者是相同环境挑战下未发生冻结的对照。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN-LFP与同步64通道EEG；分析SMA、M1、PC至同侧STN的低频耦合。\",\n      \"measure\": \"皮层—STN θ-α频段CPSD耦合，比较FOG与成功通过门口的非冻结步态。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"θ-α频段4–13 Hz；1.5秒epoch；个体化峰值频带FWHM；耦合指标相对于患者自身有效行走均值归一化。\",\n      \"finding\": \"实际FOG期间H−半球皮层—STN低频解耦，而成功通过门口时没有出现相应解耦。作者据此报告该低频解耦不是单纯由通过门口这一环境挑战引起。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"方向：FOG时耦合下降，成功通过门口时未见相应下降。未报告精确效应量、置信区间或该对照比较的精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"归一化epoch级CPSD指标；Wilcoxon rank-sum test及Bonferroni校正。研究明确报告对所有患者epoch进行池化，未报告患者层级聚类模型。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究领域级偏倚风险清单，非经验证量表。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"仅7/15名候选患者获得可用记录，FOG事件来自5人。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"实际FOG经过运动学和视频临床确认；门口通过为非冻结运动学epoch。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"报告伪迹处理，但残余运动伪迹和EEG空间定位误差不能完全排除。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"相同门口环境构成有价值的控制，但成功通过和冻结时的步态动力学并不完全相同。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"epoch级数据池化，未报告患者或事件层级聚类校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用Bonferroni校正，但多ROI、多阶段和多对照增加比较数量。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods and Results\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预注册信息。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"全文未报告预注册或分析计划\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是支持FOG特异性的重要环境对照，但成功通过门口与冻结期间的步态运动学不完全匹配。不能排除其他运动学差异造成的耦合变化。\",\n      \"quote\": \"the cortex and the STN in H− decoupled only during gait freezing and not during successful passing through a door.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Cortical-subthalamic network during gait freezing\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 4B\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"PMID31505548_E11\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性事件相关电生理研究；实际FOG与自主停止步行的对照。\",\n      \"population\": \"7名双侧STN-DBS患者；5名FOG+患者提供实际冻结事件；研究报告34个自主停止的1.5秒epoch。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 7,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 5,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 7,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 14,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": \"14根DBS导线，56个物理触点；14个双极STN-LFP记录通道。\",\n      \"missing_reason\": \"总试次数未报告；自主停止对照为34个1.5秒epoch，具体贡献患者数未单独报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"during_FOG\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off至少12小时；Stim-Off至少2小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"长期双侧STN-DBS，参数稳定至少2个月；测试时暂停刺激2小时。\",\n      \"task\": \"比较实际FOG期间与自主停止行走期间的皮层—STN低频耦合；自主停止为非FOG停止行为。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN-LFP及同步64通道EEG；SMA、M1、PC与同侧STN。\",\n      \"measure\": \"皮层—STN θ-α频段CPSD耦合。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"θ-α频段4–13 Hz；1.5秒epoch；个体化峰值频带FWHM；相对于患者自身行走平均耦合值归一化。\",\n      \"finding\": \"实际FOG期间H−半球皮层—STN低频解耦；自主停止行走时未出现相应低频解耦。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"FOG期间耦合下降；自主停止期间无相应下降。未报告精确效应量、置信区间及该对照比较的精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"CPSD归一化epoch级比较；Wilcoxon rank-sum test和Bonferroni校正。未报告患者内重复测量聚类处理。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究领域级偏倚风险清单，非经验证量表。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG事件仅来自5人，整体可用记录为7/15。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"实际FOG由IMU和视频评审确认；自主停止为研究定义的非冻结行为。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用EEG和LFP伪迹处理，但残余伪迹仍可能存在。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"自主停止对照有助于区分普通停止与FOG，但两种行为的运动学和控制需求不同。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"多epoch池化，未报告患者层级聚类校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用Bonferroni校正，但涉及多个频段和对照条件。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods and Results\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预注册信息。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"全文未报告预注册或分析计划\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"自主停止是有价值的行为对照，但不能保证与FOG在运动学、皮层控制需求和感觉反馈方面完全匹配。\",\n      \"quote\": \"the cortex and the STN (in H−) decoupled only during gait freezing and not during voluntary stop.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Cortical-subthalamic network during gait freezing\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 4C\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"PMID31505548_E12\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性事件相关电生理研究；皮层—STN β频段跨区域耦合分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"7名双侧STN-DBS患者；5名FOG+患者产生实际冻结事件。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 7,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 5,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 7,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 14,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": \"14根DBS导线，56个物理触点；14个双极STN-LFP记录通道。\",\n      \"missing_reason\": \"总试次数未报告，每人4–8次；FSTART的具体有效epoch数量未单独报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"during_FOG\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off至少12小时；Stim-Off至少2小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"长期双侧STN-DBS，参数稳定至少2个月；实验时暂停刺激2小时。具体治疗频率、幅度和脉宽未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"自然地面行走实际FOG开始阶段FSTART，与有效行走参考epoch比较。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN-LFP及64通道EEG；皮层ROI为SMA、M1、PC及颞叶控制区域。\",\n      \"measure\": \"皮层—同侧STN β频段CPSD耦合。该指标反映跨区域β耦合，不等同于STN局部β功率。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"β频段13–35 Hz；个体化峰值频带；主分析1.5秒epoch；CPSD积分后相对于患者行走平均值计算百分比变化。作者还报告进行500 ms β频段窗口的重复分析。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FSTART时H−半球皮层—STN β耦合显著增加，相对于有效行走条件。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"方向：β耦合增加；Fig.6A报告P<0.05显著性标记。正文未报告精确P值、具体百分比效应量或置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者内行走均值归一化；所有患者epoch级指标合并，Wilcoxon rank-sum test及Bonferroni校正。未报告患者层级聚类校正。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究领域级偏倚风险清单，非经验证量表。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"仅7/15名候选患者有可用记录，FOG事件仅来自5人。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"实际FOG由运动学与视频临床确认，未报告评审一致性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"报告滤波、ICA和同步处理，但无法完全排除残余运动伪迹。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"β耦合增加也可能反映停止或门口任务的一般运动控制需求。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—Cortical-subthalamic network during gait freezing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"所有患者epoch归一化值池化，未报告患者内聚类校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用Bonferroni校正，但多频段、多ROI和多时间阶段比较较多。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods and Results\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预注册或预先分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"全文未报告预注册或分析计划\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该结果不能独立证明β耦合增加是FOG特异性机制。作者在Fig.6B和Fig.6C中报告相似变化也存在于成功通过门口及自主停止行为中。\",\n      \"quote\": \"At gait freezing start (FSTART) the cortical-subthalamic coupling in the β-frequency showed a significant increase\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Cortical-subthalamic network during gait freezing\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 6A\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"PMID31505548_E13\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性事件相关电生理研究；FOG开始与成功通过门口的β耦合比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"7名双侧STN-DBS患者；5名FOG+患者产生14次实际FOG事件；另报告32个成功通过门口的1.5秒epoch。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 7,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 5,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 7,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 14,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": \"14根DBS导线，56个物理触点；14个双极STN-LFP记录通道。\",\n      \"missing_reason\": \"总试次数未报告；成功门口通过为32个epoch，具体贡献患者数未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"during_FOG\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off至少12小时；Stim-Off至少2小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"长期双侧STN-DBS，参数稳定至少2个月；实验时Stim-Off。\",\n      \"task\": \"实际FOG开始FSTART与成功通过门口的非冻结步态比较。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN-LFP及同步64通道EEG；SMA、M1、PC与同侧STN。\",\n      \"measure\": \"皮层—STN β频段CPSD耦合。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"β频段13–35 Hz；主分析1.5秒epoch；个体化峰值频带；患者内行走基线归一化。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FSTART时观察到的皮层—STN β耦合增加，在成功通过门口时也出现相似变化。该增加不能区分实际FOG与成功通过门口的行为。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"FOG开始与成功通过门口的β耦合增加相似；未报告精确效应量、置信区间或精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"CPSD积分、患者内行走基线归一化；Wilcoxon rank-sum test及Bonferroni校正。epoch级数据池化，未报告患者层级聚类处理。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究领域级偏倚风险清单，非经验证量表。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"有效神经记录7/15，FOG事件来自5人。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"实际FOG经过运动学及视频评审确认，成功门口通过为非冻结对照。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"报告信号处理流程，但残余伪迹不能完全排除。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"门口通过与FOG的运动学和行为状态可能不同，β耦合变化可能反映一般任务需求。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—Cortical-subthalamic network during gait freezing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"epoch级数据池化，未报告患者层级聚类校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"Bonferroni校正，但涉及多个比较条件。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods and Results\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预注册信息。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"全文未报告预注册或分析计划\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这一结果提示β耦合增加可能与门口通行或运动停止的一般过程有关，而非FOG独有。成功门口通过epoch的具体患者分布未报告。\",\n      \"quote\": \"The increase in β-coupling between the cortex and the STN at gait freezing start (FSTART) was similar to successful passing through a door.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Cortical-subthalamic network during gait freezing\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 6B\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"PMID31505548_E14\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性事件相关电生理研究；实际FOG开始与自主停止行为的β耦合比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"7名双侧STN-DBS患者；5名FOG+患者产生实际冻结事件；另报告34个自主停止的1.5秒epoch。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 7,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 5,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 7,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 14,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": \"14根DBS导线，56个物理触点；14个双极STN-LFP记录通道。\",\n      \"missing_reason\": \"总试次数未报告；自主停止对照34个epoch，具体贡献患者数未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"during_FOG\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off至少12小时；Stim-Off至少2小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"长期双侧STN-DBS，参数稳定至少2个月；实验时Stim-Off。\",\n      \"task\": \"实际FOG开始阶段FSTART与自主停止行走的非冻结对照比较。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN-LFP及同步64通道EEG；SMA、M1、PC与同侧STN。\",\n      \"measure\": \"皮层—STN β频段CPSD耦合。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"β频段13–35 Hz；主分析1.5秒epoch；患者内行走均值归一化。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FSTART时皮层—STN β耦合增加，但该增加与自主停止时的变化没有显著差异。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"FOG开始与自主停止之间未检测到显著差异；未报告精确P值、效应量或置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"CPSD积分和患者内基线归一化；Wilcoxon rank-sum test及Bonferroni校正；epoch级池化，未报告聚类校正。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究领域级偏倚风险清单，非经验证量表。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"有效神经记录仅7/15，实际FOG事件仅来自5人。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"实际FOG经运动学及视频确认；自主停止作为非冻结行为对照。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol, set-up and biomechanical data processing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"报告EEG和LFP信号处理，但残余伪迹无法完全排除。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG与自主停止可能具有不同运动学和任务背景。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—Cortical-subthalamic network during gait freezing\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"epoch级池化且未报告患者层级聚类校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"报告Bonferroni校正，但比较条件较多。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods and Results\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预注册信息。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"全文未报告预注册或分析计划\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"β耦合增加不是FOG特异性结果；它与自主停止的变化相似。不能将FSTART时β耦合增加直接解释为FOG病理标志。\",\n      \"quote\": \"The increase in β-coupling between the cortex and the STN at gait freezing start (FSTART) did not differ between freezing onset and voluntary stop.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Cortical-subthalamic network during gait freezing\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 6C\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"PMID31505548_E15\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性组间比较；FOG易感性分组下的非事件步态皮层—STN耦合分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"7名双侧STN-DBS患者；5名FOG+与2名从未发生FOG的FOG−患者。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 7,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 5,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 7,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 14,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": \"14根DBS导线，56个物理触点；14个双极STN-LFP记录通道。\",\n      \"missing_reason\": \"总试次数未报告，每人4–8次。此比较使用非事件有效行走epoch；研究整体另记录14次实际FOG事件，但这些事件不是本比较的结局。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"D_susceptibility\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"susceptibility\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off至少12小时；Stim-Off至少2小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"长期双侧STN-DBS，参数稳定至少2个月；测试时刺激暂停2小时。\",\n      \"task\": \"FOG+与FOG−患者在非冻结的有效自然行走状态下比较皮层—STN耦合；没有与随后发生的FOG事件进行试次级关联。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN-LFP及64通道EEG；SMA、M1、PC等运动相关皮层区域。\",\n      \"measure\": \"皮层—STN低频θ-α耦合，CPSD积分指标。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"θ-α频段4–13 Hz；1.5秒有效行走epoch；个体化峰值频带FWHM；按患者行走条件进行归一化。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FOG+和FOG−患者在有效行走期间表现出相似的皮层—STN低频耦合。作者没有发现FOG病史组之间的明显差异。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"未报告显著组间差异；未提供具体效应量、置信区间或精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"组别为5名FOG+与2名FOG−；Methods报告总体采用Wilcoxon rank-sum test和Bonferroni校正，但Fig.4D该组间比较的具体统计单位及聚合方式未充分说明。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究领域级偏倚风险清单，非经验证量表。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG−组只有2人，整体可用记录仅7/15。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Subjects and surgery; Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG+和FOG−按临床病史分组；没有报告标准化分组问卷或随访验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Subjects and surgery\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"报告EEG和STN-LFP信号处理，但残余伪迹及EEG空间定位误差不能完全排除。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG+与FOG−组样本很小，疾病严重程度及多巴胺能损失不平衡可能影响耦合。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Subjects and surgery; Results—Clinical, molecular imaging and biomechanical data\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"多个epoch来自同一患者，未明确报告患者级聚类校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"报告Bonferroni校正，但比较频段和条件较多。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods and Results\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预注册信息。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"全文未报告预注册或分析计划\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"FOG−组仅2人，未发现组间差异不能证明FOG易感性与基础低频皮层—STN耦合无关。该比较属于患者表型分组，不是实际冻结事件前的预测分析。\",\n      \"quote\": \"Subjects with and without FOG showed the same cortical-subthalamic coupling during (effective) walking\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Cortical-subthalamic network during gait freezing\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 4D\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"PMID31505548_E16\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性组间比较；FOG易感性分组下成功通过门口时的非冻结步态皮层—STN耦合分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"7名双侧STN-DBS患者；5名FOG+与2名FOG−患者。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 7,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 5,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 7,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 14,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": \"14根DBS导线，56个物理触点；14个双极STN-LFP记录通道。\",\n      \"missing_reason\": \"总试次数未报告，每人4–8次。此比较为成功通过门口的非冻结epoch；研究整体记录的14次FOG事件不属于本比较的直接结局。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"D_susceptibility\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"susceptibility\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off至少12小时；Stim-Off至少2小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"长期双侧STN-DBS，参数稳定至少2个月；实验时暂停刺激2小时。\",\n      \"task\": \"比较FOG+与FOG−患者成功通过门口时的皮层—STN低频耦合；该任务没有实际冻结事件。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN-LFP及同步64通道EEG；SMA、M1、PC与同侧STN。\",\n      \"measure\": \"皮层—STN低频θ-α耦合，CPSD积分指标。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"θ-α频段4–13 Hz；1.5秒epoch；个体化峰值频带FWHM；以患者行走平均值归一化。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FOG+与FOG−患者成功通过门口时表现出相似的皮层—STN低频耦合。未观察到FOG病史组之间的明显差异。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"未报告显著组间差异；未提供具体效应量、置信区间或精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"5名FOG+对比2名FOG−；Methods报告总体采用Wilcoxon rank-sum test及Bonferroni校正，但Fig.4D没有提供具体患者级效应估计或统计单位细节。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究领域级偏倚风险清单，非经验证量表。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG−组只有2人，整体可用记录为7/15。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Subjects and surgery; Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG+与FOG−根据临床FOG病史分组，未报告标准化量表或随访验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Subjects and surgery\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"报告滤波、ICA和同步处理，但残余伪迹及头皮EEG空间定位误差不能完全排除。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"组间疾病严重程度和多巴胺能损失可能存在差异，且未报告充分调整。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—Clinical, molecular imaging and biomechanical data\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"多个epoch来自同一患者，未报告患者层级聚类校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用Bonferroni校正，但涉及多频段、ROI和行为条件。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal recording and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods and Results\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预注册信息。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"全文未报告预注册或分析计划\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"FOG−组仅2人，不能将没有观察到的组间差异解释为不存在易感性相关神经差异。成功通过门口属于非事件试次，不应与实际FOG事件期间的神经活动混为一谈。\",\n      \"quote\": \"Subjects with and without FOG showed the same cortical-subthalamic coupling during ... successful passing through a door.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Cortical-subthalamic network during gait freezing\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 4D\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "00be6a0e-bf79-41c4-9f2a-e37103b3b505", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T112637668895Z", "elapsed_seconds": 622.266, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T11:36:59.945840+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verifi